{"sections":{"d060b446-8d13-4ecd-a072-737b4e1fff32":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--16049032331421__d060b446-8d13-4ecd-a072-737b4e1fff32-16783913522f115e35-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Impresora 3D con Calibración Automática","heading_size":"h1"}},"b3504abc-a512-4d90-af00-20bf71e4c5dc":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Las ventajas que este sistema tiene, es que nunca mas tendrás que volver a calibrar con la mano la impresora, se hace una sola vez y quedo, es casi magia<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--16049032331421__d060b446-8d13-4ecd-a072-737b4e1fff32-16783913522f115e35-0","b3504abc-a512-4d90-af00-20bf71e4c5dc"],"settings":{"desktop_content_position":"center","content_alignment":"center","color_scheme":"background-1","full_width":true,"padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":52}},"6d5f1f74-8fa0-4919-875e-003c6f4356e6":{"type":"video","settings":{"heading":"Primera parte: Conectar electronica","heading_size":"h1","enable_video_looping":false,"video_url":"https:\/\/youtu.be\/HSaMxLdqlrI","cover_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Miniatura_autoleveling_1.jpg","description":"Video sobre como conectar la electrónica para que obtengas la calibración automática","full_width":false,"color_scheme":"background-1","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"3e973cc4-647f-4412-8dbe-f588988f3c73":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--16049032331421__3e973cc4-647f-4412-8dbe-f588988f3c73-16783913522f115e35-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Diagrama de conexión para obtener tu impresora 3d con nivelación automática","heading_size":"h1"}},"template--16049032331421__3e973cc4-647f-4412-8dbe-f588988f3c73-16783913522f115e35-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>A la izquierda de la imagen, se encuentra la fuente de poder y la placa Ramps, a la derecha están los cables del sensor<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--16049032331421__3e973cc4-647f-4412-8dbe-f588988f3c73-16783913522f115e35-0","template--16049032331421__3e973cc4-647f-4412-8dbe-f588988f3c73-16783913522f115e35-1"],"settings":{"desktop_content_position":"center","content_alignment":"center","color_scheme":"background-1","full_width":true,"padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":52}},"98ce51d4-ed8b-40a8-92e4-7f7128c1f438":{"type":"slideshow","blocks":{"template--16049032331421__98ce51d4-ed8b-40a8-92e4-7f7128c1f438-167839292765597be3-0":{"type":"slide","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Diagrama_de_Conexion.jpg","heading":"","heading_size":"h1","subheading":"","button_label":"","link":"","button_style_secondary":false,"box_align":"middle-center","show_text_box":false,"text_alignment":"center","image_overlay_opacity":0,"color_scheme":"background-1","text_alignment_mobile":"center"}}},"block_order":["template--16049032331421__98ce51d4-ed8b-40a8-92e4-7f7128c1f438-167839292765597be3-0"],"settings":{"layout":"grid","slide_height":"adapt_image","slider_visual":"counter","auto_rotate":false,"change_slides_speed":5,"image_behavior":"none","show_text_below":false,"accessibility_info":"Diagrama de conexión del sensor inductivo print3x printex printec print3c"}},"1d5a050c-c372-4d7b-9f58-cec2326c7194":{"type":"custom-liquid","settings":{"custom_liquid":"<div id=\"recursos\">","color_scheme":"background-1","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0}},"ef3c9956-3839-4c73-b9c8-2b2988215698":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"3e627e71-9baf-4332-a6f9-378813a82996":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Recursos adicionales para obtener tu impresora 3d con nivelación automática","heading_size":"h1"}},"fc42638f-e889-4c33-87c6-322ada32b565":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Pieza de la tobera (imprimir sin soportes)<\/p>"}},"d3ac306f-211f-4353-8bb8-540fe8b2089d":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"Pieza de la Tobera","button_link":"https:\/\/bit.ly\/DescargarTobera","button_style_secondary":false,"button_label_2":"","button_link_2":"","button_style_secondary_2":false}},"bce5ce3e-349d-4e64-94c8-24d2e20813ac":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Piezas de la puntas de la cama<\/p>"}},"651f84c6-6b2d-4ace-a594-6713946ee209":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"Puntas de la cama","button_link":"https:\/\/bit.ly\/DescargarPuntasCama","button_style_secondary":false,"button_label_2":"","button_link_2":"","button_style_secondary_2":false}},"8757d091-cd0e-4806-95bc-2970e18a03b7":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Modelos de Sensores a color en tu maquina<\/p><p><\/p><p><strong>Sensor Capacitivo<\/strong>:<\/p><p>Tiene menor fidelidad en la distancia de detección, pero detecta todo tipo de superficies.<\/p><p>Recomendado el: LJC18A3-B-Z\/BX NPN<\/p><p><strong>Sensor inductivo<\/strong> (recomendamos ésta opción):<\/p><p>Sensor inductivo, mayor fidelidad en la detección, siempre detecta la misma distancia, pero solo detecta metales magneticos.<\/p><p>Ojo: el Aluminio no es un metal magnetico<\/p><p>El que recomendamos y usamos en nuestra maquinas es el \"LJ12A3-4-Z\/BX NPN\"<\/p><p><strong>NPN o PNP<\/strong>:<\/p><p>NPN: normalmente cerrado, está apagado, cuando detecta inducción, se prende o dispara la señal<\/p><p>PNP: normalmente abierto, siempre está encendido y cuando detecta, se apaga o termina la señal<\/p><p>Segun el tipo de lazo, abierto o cerrado, tendras que configurar la logica en el Marlin o invertirla. <\/p><p><\/p>"}}},"block_order":["3e627e71-9baf-4332-a6f9-378813a82996","fc42638f-e889-4c33-87c6-322ada32b565","d3ac306f-211f-4353-8bb8-540fe8b2089d","bce5ce3e-349d-4e64-94c8-24d2e20813ac","651f84c6-6b2d-4ace-a594-6713946ee209","8757d091-cd0e-4806-95bc-2970e18a03b7"],"settings":{"desktop_content_position":"center","content_alignment":"left","color_scheme":"background-1","full_width":true,"padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":52}},"818a7d37-64e5-424a-9a26-c62b26274553":{"type":"video","settings":{"heading":"Segunda parte: Modificar el Firmware","heading_size":"h1","enable_video_looping":false,"video_url":"https:\/\/youtu.be\/0v7mVu4zT-c","cover_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Miniatura_Autoleveling_2.jpg","description":"Miniatura del video de Autoleveling de la empresa print3x printex printec print3c","full_width":false,"color_scheme":"background-1","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"4a154c1e-ec87-4f37-9a7e-53af146c589d":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"d98f5e8e-83da-404a-9ebe-89e85548cd59":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Previo a modificar el codigo de tu Marlin, recuerda guardar un respaldo de tu versión estable de Marlin<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["d98f5e8e-83da-404a-9ebe-89e85548cd59"],"settings":{"desktop_content_position":"center","content_alignment":"center","color_scheme":"background-1","full_width":true,"padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":52}},"152994b1-2b68-4b48-846a-0dda52e2ef91":{"type":"video","settings":{"heading":"Tercera parte: Modificar el Gcode","heading_size":"h1","enable_video_looping":false,"video_url":"https:\/\/youtu.be\/LLit5ohZNTQ","cover_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Miniatura_Autoleveling_3.jpg","description":"Miniatura del video de como modificar el Gcode del Autoleveling de la empresa print3x printex printec print3c","full_width":false,"color_scheme":"background-1","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"ccf60488-30a6-4b11-a104-12a6401b0711":{"type":"custom-liquid","settings":{"custom_liquid":"<div id=\"gcodigos\">","color_scheme":"background-1","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0}},"0e2e643a-1218-4580-b50d-1303a5585ec5":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"2968d078-4285-4fcc-946a-f3d3376bbd83":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"G-Code para tener la impresora 3d con calibración automática","heading_size":"h1"}},"f6a93932-cd5e-4b38-94d1-2e77a6f9575d":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>El código Gcode son las instrucciones que lee la impresora 3D para hacer tu pieza, y para aplicar las mejoras que hemos hecho tenemos que colocar los siguientes códigos, al inicio y al final, tal como se muestra en el video<\/p>"}},"08b075ab-c445-428c-b8ce-ada5ee98cf8d":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p><strong>Star G-Code (codigo inicial)<br\/><\/strong><br\/>M109 S170 ; fija temperatura (espera hasta llegar a ella y deja pasar los movimientos)<br\/>M104 S225 ; calienta hasta la temperatura (permitiendo movimientos)<br\/>G28 ; lleva al origen<br\/>G29 ; sondea la cama (Mejora hecha por Sebastián Sanhueza de print3x.cl)<br\/>G1 X100 Y100 Z15 F5000 ; fija posición de espera <br\/><br\/><strong>End G-code (codigo Final)<br\/><\/strong><br\/>M104 S0 ; Enfria el hotend<br\/>G28 X0  ; home X axis<br\/>G1 Y180.000 ; Entrega la pieza (Mejora hecha por Sebastián Sanhueza de print3x.cl)<br\/>M84 ; disable motor <br\/>M107 ; Apaga ventilador<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["2968d078-4285-4fcc-946a-f3d3376bbd83","f6a93932-cd5e-4b38-94d1-2e77a6f9575d","08b075ab-c445-428c-b8ce-ada5ee98cf8d"],"settings":{"desktop_content_position":"center","content_alignment":"left","color_scheme":"background-1","full_width":true,"padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":52}},"main":{"type":"main-article","disabled":true,"blocks":{"featured_image":{"type":"featured_image","settings":{"image_height":"medium"}},"title":{"type":"title","settings":{"blog_show_date":false,"blog_show_author":false}},"share":{"type":"share","disabled":true,"settings":{"share_label":"Share"}},"content":{"type":"content","disabled":true,"settings":{}}},"block_order":["featured_image","title","share","content"],"settings":{}},"newsletter":{"type":"newsletter","disabled":true,"blocks":{"heading":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Únete al mundo de los alquimistas 3D","heading_size":"h1"}},"paragraph":{"type":"paragraph","settings":{"text":"<p>y conquista la transmutación de piezas 3D<\/p>"}},"email-form":{"type":"email_form","settings":{}}},"block_order":["heading","paragraph","email-form"],"settings":{"color_scheme":"accent-2","full_width":true,"padding_top":60,"padding_bottom":20}}},"order":["d060b446-8d13-4ecd-a072-737b4e1fff32","6d5f1f74-8fa0-4919-875e-003c6f4356e6","3e973cc4-647f-4412-8dbe-f588988f3c73","98ce51d4-ed8b-40a8-92e4-7f7128c1f438","1d5a050c-c372-4d7b-9f58-cec2326c7194","ef3c